{"unit_id": "tag:01MY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为两个分次（graded）的环（rings）。\n置（Set）<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>。\n设<MATH_0005>为一个分次环（graded ring）映射（map）。\n置（Set）\n<MATHSEG_0001>齐次（homogeneous）<MATHSEG_0002>\n则存在一个概形（schemes）的典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0006>\n以及一个<MATH_0007>-分次（graded）的<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）之间的映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>\n三元组（triple）<MATH_0010>由下列性质刻画：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个<MATH_0011>，图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0012>\n都是交换的（commutative）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意齐次（homogeneous）的<MATH_0013>，\n都有<MATH_0014>，且\n<MATH_0015>在<MATH_0016>上的限制（restriction）\n对应于环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0017>，该映射由<MATH_0018>诱导（induced）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "Set", "target_term": "置"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Set", "target_term": "置"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "说明开头两个环均带有分次。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "指开头给定的两个环。"}, {"source_term": "Set", "target_term": "置", "context": "引入两个记号。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "限定所给映射涉及的环及其分次。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所给的分次环映射。"}, {"source_term": "Set", "target_term": "置", "context": "引入随后陈列的定义。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "陈列定义中露出的数学文字。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指典范态射所涉及的对象。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指所断言存在的概形态射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "说明所涉及的代数具有指定分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指第二个所构造的映射所涉及的对象。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指所构造的分次代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "指由随后的性质刻画的三个对象组成的有序组。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指第一项性质中陈列的图表。"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的", "context": "陈述第一项性质中图表的交换性。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "限定第二项性质中的任意元素。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指将态射限制到所指定的子集。"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "指与态射的限制相对应的环映射。"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导", "context": "说明该环映射由随后指定的数据诱导。"}], "notes": []}
